  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When a humanoid collider (Head, Torso, Hand, Foot, Finger) is set to Disabled, it retains it's previous values and the transform value is still updated (not set to null, due to https://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/custom-humanoid-collider-transforms-overridden), in-game this results the collider still being set, even though it was \"Disabled\".\n\nThis results broken \"automatic\" colliders (https://feedback.vrchat.com/sdk-bug-reports/p/humanoid-colliders-may-divide-by-zero) to still exist in-game.",
